---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../utils/withBase";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Inside My Classroom"
  description="A window into real teaching practice — curriculum design, learning routines, assessment, and day-to-day life in the classroom."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell two-column">
      <div class="stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">Inside My Classroom</span>
        <h1>How this actually works in a real classroom.</h1>
        <p>
          This section answers the question teachers ask most: <em>but what does it actually look like?</em>
          Real examples, real routines, and real reflections from day-to-day practice.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">What you'll find here</span>
        <h3>Practical, not theoretical</h3>
        <ul class="list-clean">
          <li>Curriculum planning and alignment examples</li>
          <li>Assessment and reflection systems in action</li>
          <li>Daily routines and classroom structures</li>
          <li>Unit and lesson design, start to finish</li>
          <li>Events, experiences, and large-scale planning</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="stack">
          <span class="eyebrow">Curriculum Design & Alignment</span>
          <h2>Building a curriculum that connects vertically and horizontally.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="classroom-grid">
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Vertical Progression</h3>
          <p>How skills and concepts build deliberately across year levels — so students aren't starting from scratch each year.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources#vertical-horizontal-alignment")}>See the alignment infographic →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Horizontal Alignment</h3>
          <p>How units across subjects connect at the same year level — building coherence without losing subject identity.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources#vertical-horizontal-alignment")}>See the alignment infographic →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>IB Curriculum Mapping</h3>
          <p>Practical examples of mapping IB frameworks to real units — keeping the documentation useful rather than decorative.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources")}>Browse planning resources →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="stack">
          <span class="eyebrow">Making Learning Visible</span>
          <h2>When students can see their learning, they take ownership of it.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="classroom-grid">
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Assessment in Practice</h3>
          <p>Assessment that informs teaching — not just grades. Examples of how formative and summative tasks work together.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Student Reflection</h3>
          <p>Simple, consistent reflection routines that help students understand what they've learned and where to go next.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Feedback That Works</h3>
          <p>Practical feedback strategies that students actually use — specific, timely, and connected to next steps.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources#making-learning-visible")}>See the infographic →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="stack">
          <span class="eyebrow">Daily Routines & Structures</span>
          <h2>The systems that make a classroom run smoothly.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="classroom-grid">
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Lesson Openings</h3>
          <p>How a lesson starts shapes everything that follows. Intentional openings that settle students and signal what's coming.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources#how-you-start-shapes-everything")}>See the G.R.E.E.T prompt card →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Reducing Teacher Talk</h3>
          <p>The L.E.S.S framework in practice — how to give clearer instructions, ask better questions, and create more thinking time.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources#say-less-get-more")}>See the L.E.S.S prompt card →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Transitions & Flow</h3>
          <p>Smooth transitions that don't lose momentum — practical signals, routines, and structures that keep class flow consistent.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="shell">

      <!-- ROW 1: Text left + iPad right (Option A style) -->
      <div class="tech-top">
        <div class="tech-text stack">
          <span class="eyebrow">Tech Integration in PE</span>
          <h2>A PE challenge app students actually want to use.</h2>
          <p>Built for the gym. Runs on any iPad or laptop. No login, no setup — just open and go. Four challenge categories, progressive difficulty levels, video demos, and built-in score logging.</p>
          <ul class="tech-feature-list">
            <li>Easy → Medium → Hard progression per challenge</li>
            <li>Video demo filmed in a real gym for every challenge</li>
            <li>Score logging + reflection built in</li>
            <li>No app download — works in any browser</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tech-intro-actions">
            <a class="button" href="/pe-challenges.html" target="_blank">Open the app →</a>
            <a class="button-secondary" href={withBase("/say-hello")}>Request a demo</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-ipad">
          <div class="ipad-landscape">
            <div class="ipad-left-bar"><div class="ipad-camera-side"></div></div>
            <div class="ipad-screen-landscape">
              <div class="app-mockup">
                <div class="app-header"><span class="app-trophy">🏆</span><span class="app-title">PE Challenges</span></div>
                <p class="app-subtitle">Choose a category to get started</p>
                <div class="app-categories">
                  <div class="app-cat orange"><span class="app-cat-icon">🏀</span><strong>Sport Skills</strong><span>Measurable sport challenges</span></div>
                  <div class="app-cat blue"><span class="app-cat-icon">💪</span><strong>Fitness Challenges</strong><span>Strength &amp; endurance tests</span></div>
                  <div class="app-cat green"><span class="app-cat-icon">🎯</span><strong>Target Games</strong><span>Accuracy &amp; focus tasks</span></div>
                  <div class="app-cat purple"><span class="app-cat-icon">🤸</span><strong>Movement Circuits</strong><span>Station-based activities</span></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ipad-right-bar"><div class="ipad-home-side"></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ROW 2: 3 feature cards (Option B style) -->
      <div class="tech-features">
        <div class="tech-feat-card green-top">
          <span class="tech-feat-icon">🎯</span>
          <h4>Progressive Difficulty</h4>
          <p>Easy, Medium and Hard challenges unlock in sequence — students stay motivated and challenged at their own level.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-feat-card orange-top">
          <span class="tech-feat-icon">📹</span>
          <h4>Video Demonstrations</h4>
          <p>Every challenge includes a real classroom video demo so students know exactly what to do before they start.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-feat-card purple-top">
          <span class="tech-feat-icon">📝</span>
          <h4>Score & Reflect</h4>
          <p>Students log their score, rate their effort, and write a short reflection — building self-assessment habits every lesson.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PE Circle -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="circle-section">

        <div class="circle-text stack">
          <div class="circle-badges">
            <span class="badge-private">🔒 Teacher Only</span>
            <span class="badge-tool">AI-Assisted Teacher Tool</span>
          </div>
          <span class="eyebrow">PE Circle</span>
          <h2>What if the tools we use actually helped us be more present with students?</h2>
          <p>
            PE Circle is a teacher-facing app for opening and closing PE lessons with intention.
            It tracks student readiness, wellbeing, and ATL skills in real time — and closes every
            lesson with structured reflection, IB-aligned prompts, and a celebration moment.
          </p>
          <ul class="tech-feature-list">
            <li>At-a-glance student readiness — who needs a check-in before class starts</li>
            <li>Closing reflection linked to ATL skills and the IB Learner Profile</li>
            <li>Structured sharing protocol and closing energiser built in</li>
            <li>Works across all 13 classes — syncs history to Google Sheets</li>
            <li>Password protected — completely private, built for your context</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="circle-quote">
            "Built specifically for my school, my students, and my IB framework —
            not an off-the-shelf product."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="circle-visual">
          <div class="circle-ipad">
            <div class="ipad-landscape">
              <div class="ipad-left-bar"><div class="ipad-camera-side"></div></div>
              <div class="ipad-screen-landscape">
                <div class="circle-mockup">
                  <div class="circle-app-header">
                    <span class="circle-app-icon">⭕</span>
                    <span class="circle-app-title">PE Circle</span>
                    <span class="circle-app-class">G4B — Morning</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="circle-app-body">
                    <div class="circle-phase">
                      <p class="circle-phase-label">OPENING CHECK-IN</p>
                      <div class="circle-students">
                        <div class="cs green">😊<span>Ready</span></div>
                        <div class="cs green">😊<span>Ready</span></div>
                        <div class="cs amber">😐<span>Check in</span></div>
                        <div class="cs green">😊<span>Ready</span></div>
                        <div class="cs red">😔<span>Support</span></div>
                        <div class="cs green">😊<span>Ready</span></div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="circle-divider"></div>
                    <div class="circle-phase">
                      <p class="circle-phase-label">CLOSING REFLECTION</p>
                      <div class="circle-atl">
                        <div class="atl-tag">Self-Management</div>
                        <div class="atl-tag">Communication</div>
                        <div class="atl-tag">Reflective 🌱</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="circle-prompt">"What did you adjust during the lesson to improve?"</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ipad-right-bar"><div class="ipad-home-side"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="circle-caption">Password protected — teacher access only</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="shell two-column">
      <div class="quote-card stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">More coming soon</span>
        <h2>Unit design, events, and real lesson examples on the way.</h2>
        <p>
          This section grows alongside the resource library. Upcoming additions include full unit planning examples,
          Athletics Day organisation, and real lesson walkthroughs with reflections.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">In the meantime</span>
        <h3>Start with the resources</h3>
        <p>The downloadable resources are the most practical starting point — prompt cards, infographics, and planning tools ready to use today.</p>
        <a class="button" href={withBase("/resources")} style="width: fit-content; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Browse resources</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .classroom-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .card-cta {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .card-cta:hover {
    color: var(--accent-deep);
  }

  em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent-deep);
  }

  /* ── Tech top row (A style) ── */
  .tech-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .tech-text { }

  .tech-feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tech-feature-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .tech-feature-list li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: #27ae60;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .tech-intro-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tech-ipad { }

  /* ── Feature cards (B style) ── */
  .tech-features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .tech-feat-card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: box-shadow 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  }

  .tech-feat-card:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .green-top  { border-top: 3px solid #27ae60; }
  .orange-top { border-top: 3px solid #ff6b35; }
  .purple-top { border-top: 3px solid #6c5ce7; }

  .tech-feat-icon { font-size: 1.75rem; }

  .tech-feat-card h4 {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .tech-feat-card p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: none;
  }

  /* ── Landscape iPad ── */
  .ipad-landscape {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    background: #1c1c1e;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px #3a3a3a,
      0 32px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.4),
      inset 0 0 0 2px #2a2a2a;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ipad-left-bar {
    width: 18px;
    background: #1c1c1e;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ipad-camera-side {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #3a3a3a;
    border: 1px solid #444;
  }

  .ipad-screen-landscape {
    flex: 1;
    background: #f0f0f5;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }

  .ipad-right-bar {
    width: 22px;
    background: #1c1c1e;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ipad-home-side {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid #3a3a3a;
    background: #252525;
  }

  /* ── App Mockup ── */
  .app-mockup {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .app-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: #6c5ce7;
    margin: -1rem -1.25rem 0;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .app-trophy {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .app-title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }

  .app-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0.1rem;
    max-width: none;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .app-categories {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .app-cat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 2.5px solid transparent;
    background: #fff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .app-cat.orange { border-color: #ff6b35; }
  .app-cat.blue   { border-color: #4a90d9; }
  .app-cat.green  { border-color: #27ae60; }
  .app-cat.purple { border-color: #9b59b6; }

  .app-cat-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; }

  .app-cat strong {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2c2c2c;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .app-cat span {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: #888;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  /* ── PE Circle ── */
  .circle-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .circle-badges {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .badge-private {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    background: #2c2c2c;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .badge-tool {
    display: inline-flex;
    background: var(--terra-soft);
    color: var(--terra-deep);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .circle-quote {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--terra);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .circle-caption {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    max-width: none;
  }

  /* Circle app mockup */
  .circle-mockup {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: #f5f5fa;
  }

  .circle-app-header {
    background: #2d3561;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .circle-app-icon { font-size: 1rem; }

  .circle-app-title {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .circle-app-class {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .circle-app-body {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .circle-phase-label {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #999;
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .circle-students {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .cs {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.2rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .cs span {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .cs.green  { background: #27ae60; }
  .cs.amber  { background: #f39c12; }
  .cs.red    { background: #e74c3c; }

  .circle-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    margin: 0.1rem 0;
  }

  .circle-atl {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .atl-tag {
    background: #2d3561;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .circle-prompt {
    background: #fff;
    border-left: 3px solid #2d3561;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #555;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .classroom-grid,
    .tech-top,
    .tech-features,
    .circle-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
